        "stored_content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-header\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} --><header class=\"wp-block-group site-header\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"brand\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\">\n        <img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n        Quillfern Cycle Works\n      <\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cbutton class=\\u0022nav-toggle\\u0022 type=\\u0022button\\u0022 aria-controls=\\u0022site-nav\\u0022 aria-expanded=\\u0022false\\u0022\\u003eMenu\\u003c\/button\\u003e\"} --><button class=\"nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu<\/button><!-- \/wp:html --><!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"site-nav\",\"className\":\"site-nav\",\"tagName\":\"nav\",\"ariaLabel\":\"Main\"} --><nav id=\"site-nav\" class=\"wp-block-group site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Home<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/nav><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/header><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\"} --><main class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"hero\",\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group hero\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your bike, running like the day you got it<\/h1><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A small repair workshop in Larkbend. Tune-ups, wheel builds and cargo bike care, done while you wait or by the next morning.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Book a repair<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we do<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"cards\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group cards\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tune-ups<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Gears indexed, brakes set, chain cleaned and every bolt checked to torque.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#tune-ups\">See tune-up levels<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wheels<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Truing, spoke replacement and hand-built wheels for road, gravel and town bikes.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#wheels\">See wheel work<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cargo bikes<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Longtails and front-loaders, with the space and the stands to work on them properly.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html#cargo\">See cargo care<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Open today<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"open-row\"} --><p class=\"open-row\"><svg class=\"icon-wrench\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"wrench-title\">\n            <title id=\"wrench-title\">Wrench icon<\/title>\n            <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e9a64b\"\/>\n            <path d=\"M30 10a8 8 0 0 0-7.6 10.4L11 31.8 16.2 37l11.4-11.4A8 8 0 0 0 38 18l-5 2-4-4 2-5z\" fill=\"#1f4e5f\"\/>\n          <\/svg>\n          <span id=\"open-status\">The workshop is open Tuesday to Saturday, 9:00 to 17:30.<\/span><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>They had my commuter back the same afternoon, and it shifts better than it did new.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><cite>A rider from Larkbend (a made-up quote for this test)<\/cite><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/blockquote><!-- \/wp:quote --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><\/main><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} --><footer class=\"wp-block-group site-footer\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap footer-cols\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap footer-cols\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quillfern Cycle Works<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14 Ferrule Lane, Larkbend<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pages<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Quillfern Cycle Works is a fictional business, made for a software test.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>&copy; <span class=\"year\">2026<\/span> Sample site, MIT licence.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/footer><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cscript\\u003e\\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year and say whether the shop is open right now.\\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) =\\u003e {\\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\\n    });\\n    (function () {\\n      const now = new Date();\\n      const day = now.getDay();\\n      const hour = now.getHours() + now.getMinutes() \/ 60;\\n      const open = day \\u003e= 2 \\u0026\\u0026 day \\u003c= 6 \\u0026\\u0026 hour \\u003e= 9 \\u0026\\u0026 hour \\u003c 17.5;\\n      const status = document.getElementById('open-status');\\n      if (status) {\\n        status.textContent += open ? ' We are open right now.' : ' We are closed right now.';\\n      }\\n    })();\\n  \\u003c\/script\\u003e\"} --><script>\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year and say whether the shop is open right now.\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) => {\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\n    });\n    (function () {\n      const now = new Date();\n      const day = now.getDay();\n      const hour = now.getHours() + now.getMinutes() \/ 60;\n      const open = day >= 2 && day <= 6 && hour >= 9 && hour < 17.5;\n      const status = document.getElementById('open-status');\n      if (status) {\n        status.textContent += open ? ' We are open right now.' : ' We are closed right now.';\n      }\n    })();\n  <\/script><!-- \/wp:html -->"
