        "stored_content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-header\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} --><header class=\"wp-block-group site-header\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"brand\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\">\n        <img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n        Quillfern Cycle Works\n      <\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cbutton class=\\u0022nav-toggle\\u0022 type=\\u0022button\\u0022 aria-controls=\\u0022site-nav\\u0022 aria-expanded=\\u0022false\\u0022\\u003eMenu\\u003c\/button\\u003e\"} --><button class=\"nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu<\/button><!-- \/wp:html --><!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"site-nav\",\"className\":\"site-nav\",\"tagName\":\"nav\",\"ariaLabel\":\"Main\"} --><nav id=\"site-nav\" class=\"wp-block-group site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\">Home<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\" aria-current=\"page\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/nav><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/header><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\"} --><main class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About the workshop<\/h1><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Quillfern Cycle Works is two benches, one truing stand and a long wall of parts drawers. We fix the bikes people ride every day.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How a repair goes<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>You bring the bike in, or book a slot on the <a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">contact page<\/a>.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We look it over with you and write down a price before any work starts.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We do the work, test ride it, and text you when it is ready.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>You collect it and we show you what we changed.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ol><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fix before replace<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A worn part gets replaced. A part that can be cleaned, adjusted or trued gets that instead.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} --><h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we will always tell you<\/h4><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>What is worn, and how long it has left.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>What is safe to leave for now.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>What it costs, before we start.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Every bike leaves road-tested<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>No bike goes back to its rider until one of us has ridden it round the block.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A bike that is looked after lasts for decades. Most of the work is small and regular.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><cite>The workshop's house rule<\/cite><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/blockquote><!-- \/wp:quote --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">From the bench<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:gallery --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"600\",\"height\":\"400\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/gallery-roadster.svg\" alt=\"Drawing of a roadster bicycle\" style=\"width:600px;height:400px\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">A roadster rebuild: new bearings and a fresh chain.<\/figcaption><\/figure><!-- \/wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"600\",\"height\":\"400\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/gallery-commuter.svg\" alt=\"Drawing of a commuter bicycle\" style=\"width:600px;height:400px\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">A commuter tune-up, back the same afternoon.<\/figcaption><\/figure><!-- \/wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"600\",\"height\":\"400\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/gallery-cargo.svg\" alt=\"Drawing of a cargo bicycle\" style=\"width:600px;height:400px\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Cargo bike service, on the long stand.<\/figcaption><\/figure><!-- \/wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"600\",\"height\":\"400\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/gallery-wheels.svg\" alt=\"Drawing of a bicycle on a truing stand\" style=\"width:600px;height:400px\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Wheel truing, to half a millimetre.<\/figcaption><\/figure><!-- \/wp:image --><\/figure><!-- \/wp:gallery --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A short film we like<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Big Buck Bunny, an open film from the Blender Foundation (CC BY 3.0). It has nothing to do with bikes, but it is free to share.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"embed\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group embed\"><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003ciframe src=\\u0022https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/aqz-KE-bpKQ\\u0022 title=\\u0022Big Buck Bunny, Blender Foundation\\u0022 loading=\\u0022lazy\\u0022 allow=\\u0022accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\\u0022 allowfullscreen\\u003e\\u003c\/iframe\\u003e\"} --><iframe src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube-nocookie.com\/embed\/aqz-KE-bpKQ\" title=\"Big Buck Bunny, Blender Foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><!-- \/wp:html --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><\/main><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} --><footer class=\"wp-block-group site-footer\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap footer-cols\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap footer-cols\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quillfern Cycle Works<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14 Ferrule Lane, Larkbend<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pages<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Quillfern Cycle Works is a fictional business, made for a software test.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>&copy; <span class=\"year\">2026<\/span> Sample site, MIT licence.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/footer><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cscript\\u003e\\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year.\\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) =\\u003e {\\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\\n    });\\n  \\u003c\/script\\u003e\"} --><script>\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year.\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) => {\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\n    });\n  <\/script><!-- \/wp:html -->"
