        "stored_content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-header\",\"tagName\":\"header\"} --><header class=\"wp-block-group site-header\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"brand\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\">\n        <img src=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/assets\/img\/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">\n        Quillfern Cycle Works\n      <\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cbutton class=\\u0022nav-toggle\\u0022 type=\\u0022button\\u0022 aria-controls=\\u0022site-nav\\u0022 aria-expanded=\\u0022false\\u0022\\u003eMenu\\u003c\/button\\u003e\"} --><button class=\"nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"site-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu<\/button><!-- \/wp:html --><!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"site-nav\",\"className\":\"site-nav\",\"tagName\":\"nav\",\"ariaLabel\":\"Main\"} --><nav id=\"site-nav\" class=\"wp-block-group site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/index.html\">Home<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\" aria-current=\"page\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/nav><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/header><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\"} --><main class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --><h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Services and prices<\/h1><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prices are fixed for labour. Parts are extra, and we tell you the part price before we fit anything. All prices are invented for this sample site.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"tune-ups\",\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tune-up levels<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Service<\/th><th>What is included<\/th><th>Time<\/th><th>Price<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><th>Safety check<\/th><td>Brakes, tyres, bolts, chain wear<\/td><td>20 min<\/td><td>15<\/td><\/tr><tr><th>Standard tune-up<\/th><td>Safety check, gears indexed, brakes adjusted, chain cleaned<\/td><td>1 hour<\/td><td>45<\/td><\/tr><tr><th>Full service<\/th><td>Standard tune-up, bearings serviced, wheels trued, cables replaced<\/td><td>Next morning<\/td><td>110<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Labour prices, in made-up sample currency.<\/figcaption><\/figure><!-- \/wp:table --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"anchor\":\"wheels\",\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wheels and cargo bikes<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"cards\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group cards\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wheel truing<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A wobbly wheel trued on the stand, with spoke tension evened out.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Up to 3 spokes replaced<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Same-day for most wheels<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hand-built wheels<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Built to your rims and hubs, tensioned and stress-relieved.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Ready in five working days<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Free re-true after a month<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"cargo\",\"className\":\"card\",\"tagName\":\"article\"} --><article id=\"cargo\" class=\"wp-block-group card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cargo bike care<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Longtails and front-loaders on our long stand, including steering and child-seat checks.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Booked slots only<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Collection by arrangement<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/article><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Check your chain at home<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Between visits, a chain checker tells you when a chain is worn. Here is the rule we use, written as code:<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:code {\"className\":\"language-js\"} --><pre class=\"wp-block-code language-js\"><code>\/\/ Chain wear, measured with a checker gauge.\nfunction chainAdvice(wearPercent) {\n  if (wearPercent &gt;= 0.75) {\n    return &#039;Replace the chain, and check the cassette.&#039;;\n  }\n  if (wearPercent &gt;= 0.5) {\n    return &#039;Replace the chain soon.&#039;;\n  }\n  return &#039;The chain is fine.&#039;;\n}<\/code><\/pre><!-- \/wp:code --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Shift to the smallest rear cog.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Drop the checker into the chain.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Read the gauge, then run the rule above.<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ol><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Book a service<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><\/main><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"site-footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\"} --><footer class=\"wp-block-group site-footer\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap footer-cols\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap footer-cols\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quillfern Cycle Works<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>14 Ferrule Lane, Larkbend<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pages<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/about.html\">About<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">Services<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/contact.html\">Contact<\/a><\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Quillfern Cycle Works is a fictional business, made for a software test.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>&copy; <span class=\"year\">2026<\/span> Sample site, MIT licence.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/footer><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003cscript\\u003e\\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year.\\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) =\\u003e {\\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\\n    });\\n  \\u003c\/script\\u003e\"} --><script>\n    \/\/ Marks the page so the test can see this inline script ran.\n    document.body.dataset.inlineScript = 'ran';\n    \/\/ Inline script: fill in the year.\n    document.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach((el) => {\n      el.textContent = String(new Date().getFullYear());\n    });\n  <\/script><!-- \/wp:html -->"
