class=\"wp-block-heading\">Book a repair<\/h1><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell us about the bike and when you can bring it in. We reply within one working day.<\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"booking\"} --><div id=\"booking\" class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Send booking request<\/a><\/div><!-- \/wp:button --><\/div><!-- \/wp:buttons --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/div><!-- \/wp:group --><\/section><!-- \/wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"wrap\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group wrap\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find the workshop<\/h2><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:html {\"content\":\"\\u003csvg class=\\u0022map\\u0022 width=\\u0022320\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 320 200\\u0022 role=\\u0022img\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\u0022map-title\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003ctitle id=\\u0022map-title\\u0022\\u003eMap showing the workshop on Ferrule Lane, next to the park\\u003c\/title\\u003e\\n          \\u003crect width=\\u0022320\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#e3efe9\\u0022\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003crect x=\\u00220\\u0022 y=\\u002290\\u0022 width=\\u0022320\\u0022 height=\\u002222\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#ffffff\\u0022\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003crect x=\\u0022150\\u0022 y=\\u00220\\u0022 width=\\u002220\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#ffffff\\u0022\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003crect x=\\u0022190\\u0022 y=\\u0022125\\u0022 width=\\u0022110\\u0022 height=\\u002260\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#b8d8c4\\u0022\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003ccircle cx=\\u0022120\\u0022 cy=\\u002280\\u0022 r=\\u002210\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#8a3b12\\u0022\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003ctext x=\\u002210\\u0022 y=\\u0022106\\u0022 font-family=\\u0022sans-serif\\u0022 font-size=\\u002212\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#1a2624\\u0022\\u003eFerrule Lane\\u003c\/text\\u003e\\n          \\u003ctext x=\\u0022205\\u0022 y=\\u0022160\\u0022 font-family=\\u0022sans-serif\\u0022 font-size=\\u002212\\u0022 fill=\\u0022#1a2624\\u0022\\u003eLarkbend Park\\u003c\/text\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\/svg\\u003e\"} --><svg class=\"map\" width=\"320\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"map-title\">\n          <title id=\"map-title\">Map showing the workshop on Ferrule Lane, next to the park<\/title>\n          <rect width=\"320\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#e3efe9\"\/>\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"90\" width=\"320\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\"\/>\n          <rect x=\"150\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\"\/>\n          <rect x=\"190\" y=\"125\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#b8d8c4\"\/>\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"80\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8a3b12\"\/>\n          <text x=\"10\" y=\"106\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1a2624\">Ferrule Lane<\/text>\n          <text x=\"205\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1a2624\">Larkbend Park<\/text>\n        <\/svg><!-- \/wp:html --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Opening hours<\/h3><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":false} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Tuesday to Friday: 9:00 to 17:30<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Saturday: 9:00 to 16:00<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Sunday and Monday: closed<\/li><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+15555550142\">555-0142<\/a> (a fictional number). Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@quillfern.example\">hello@quillfern.example<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:9400\/sample-site\/services.html\">See services and prices<\/a><\/p><!-- \/wp:paragraph -->